SPDX-License-Identifier: CC0-1.0

Official signing certificates of VPN, proxy and circumvention apps, collected by the Datapavan project
and dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/).
Recorded in ADR 0015 and ADR 0018.

apps.tsv, sources.tsv
    Written by the project.

signers.tsv
    Written by update.py from the sources each row names: fingerprints that developers publish,
    F-Droid's metadata, the indexes of F-Droid, IzzyOnDroid, the Guardian Project and FlClash, and APKs
    from official channels. Only certificate fingerprints are taken, which are facts about published
    files; the legal review before the first public release covers this (ADR 0015, decision 12).

update.py
    The collector: Apache-2.0, like the rest of this repository.
